id: disguised-dragon
name: Disguised Dragon
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Shadow Dragon
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Hiding in plain sight amongst the other races, you manage to keep attention off of yourself by taking on a less draconic appearance. Despite your wonderful disguise, however, you are still a dragon underneath it all, and woe be upon any who incurs your wrath.
